(In the expansion, hold is an element of the list, not the top-level buffer of the same name.)
a buffer called hold is "abc".

To 'grow' with a buffer called data.
    For each k from 1 to 3000, append "abcdefgh" to data.
    Print "grew {data's size}".

To 'shadow'.
    'grow' of each hold from ["x", "y"].

'shadow'.
Print "hold {hold's size}".
